<DocsExample TExample="MultiPaneViewDashboardExample" Title="Dashboard panes" Description="NTMultiPaneView arranges direct children as peer panes. PaneCount (1 to 5) sets how many share a row when there is room; panes wrap when narrower than MinPaneWidth." />
<DocsExample TExample="MultiPaneViewMinWidthExample" Title="Minimum pane width" Description="MinPaneWidth (Compact 240px, Medium 320px, Large 360px, ExtraLarge 412px) controls when panes wrap, and EnforceEvenSizing keeps panes the same width." />
